# Source textures are real assets, not screenshots
!assets-src/**/*.png
# CitySurvivalLite: licence forbids sharing the raw files; keep local only
assets-src/city-survival-lite/
# Zombie Apocalypse Survivor (Unity Asset Store package): keep the raw files local only
assets-src/survivor-v3/
# Low-Poly Zombie Asset Pack: keep the raw pack local only (built GLBs are in public/models/zombies/)
assets-src/zombies-lowpoly/
# Molten Maps SciFi pack (CC0, `space` release): raw GLBs stay local; the built kit is public/models/facility/
assets-src/molten-scifi/
# Hell map sources (`hell` release): Inferno World, SHS Dungeon Pack (no raw redistribution), lava textures
assets-src/inferno-world/
assets-src/shs-dungeon/
# hell2 release packs (Bestiary, Codersan alien, Quaternius, alien buildings, cyber demons): raw files local only
assets-src/hell2/
# Plasma / Hellfire rifle sources (AR_2, AR_3, supplied in chat; licence unknown): raw files local only
assets-src/new-ars/
